[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Experimental GNOME Shell 49 for native FreeBSD Wayland.

Use the matching BSD3 user-session launcher and session graph. GNOME 49 no
longer provides the previous built-in session manager. This package alone
does not configure a working desktop or login manager.

Headless rendering tests do not establish hardware, VT, input, full-session
startup or logout acceptance. Preserve a working boot environment until the
complete candidate has passed native CI and an agreed hardware login trial.
EOM
}
]
